<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Strict//EN" "http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-strict.dtd">
<html>
<head>
	<meta content="text/html;charset=utf-8" http-equiv="Content-Type">
	<title>Intel Registration Rejection</title>
	
</head>
<body style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: none;background-color: #f9f9f9;background: url(https://tstcqcontent-ssl.cps.intel.com/etc/designs/intel/us/en/images/gradiantbg-body.png) repeat-x scroll left top #f9f9f9;height: 100%;outline: medium none;font-family: &quot;Intel Clear&quot;, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-weight: normal;font-size: 10pt;color: #666666;">
<table style="background-color: #ffffff; margin: 0 10px; overflow: hidden; width: 550pt; line-height: 20px; border: 1px solid #E5E5E5;">
<tbody>
<tr style="height: 320px;">
<td colspan="2" style="color: #086db6; font-size: 24pt; padding-top: 50px; padding-bottom: 12px; padding-left: 50px; font-family: 'Intel Clear', TAHOMA; height: 100px;">
<p style="margin-bottom: 0px; margin-top: 0px; font-family: 'Intel Clear Pro','TAHOMA'; color: #003c71; font-size: 28pt;"><img src="https://messagecenter.intel.com/v1/images/uploads/34749eb0-3742-11ec-9e86-55b8d111e922.png" alt="" title="devzone-premier-header_720x160@2x.png" width="700" height="156"></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 17px;">
<td colspan="2" style="padding-left: 50px; padding-right: 40px; height: 17px;font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA'; font-size: 10pt;"><hr style="background-color: #e5e5e5;border: 0 none; height: 1px;">Please DO NOT reply to this e-mail message. This is an automated response.</td>
</tr>


<tr style="height: 17px;">
<td colspan="2" id="emailMainDiv" style="font-family: 'Intel Clear', TAHOMA; padding-left: 50px; padding-top: 30px; height: 20px;">
<p><span style="font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA'; font-size: 10pt;">Dear {!PRM_Registration_Request__c.PRM_First_Name__c} {!PRM_Registration_Request__c.PRM_Last_Name__c},</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr id="emailBody" style="height: 152px;">
<td colspan="2" style="padding-left: 50px; padding-top: 10px; padding-right: 50px; height: 152px;">
<p style="margin-bottom: 0px; margin-top: 0px; font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA'; font-size: 10pt;">We appreciate your interest in Intel's Developer Zone, however, upon review of your application we regret to inform you that your request for a Premier Account has been declined. Reasons Intel may decline your request include:</p>
<ul style='padding-left: 17px'>
<li style="font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA'; font-size: 10pt;">Application does not meet the Developer Zone Premier program criteria, available in the Developer Zone Premier <a href='https://www.intel.com/content/dam/www/public/us/en/documents/license-agreements/developer-zone-premier-terms-of-use.pdf'>Terms & Conditions. </a></li>
<li style="font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA'; font-size: 10pt;">Premier access to Intel's Developer Zone requires a Corporate Non-Disclosure Agreement (CNDA) between your company and Intel, or you are a party to the Intel® Partner Alliance Terms and Conditions.</li>
<li style="font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA';font-size: 10pt;">Developer Zone Premier access requires the account to have an active Intel Account Representative or be an active Intel Partner Alliance member*</li>
</ul>
</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 20px;">
<td colspan="2" style="padding-left: 50px; padding-right: 40px;padding-bottom: 10px; height: 17px;font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA'; font-size: 10pt;">You may continue to use your Standard account to access public content in the Developer Zone.  Below please find a menu of valuable resources that have been enabled with your continued growth in mind.</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 20px;">
<td colspan="2" style="padding-left: 50px; padding-right: 40px; height: 17px;font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA'; font-size: 10pt;">To ensure that you continue receiving our e-mails, please add us to your address book. Additionally, we have several distributors and resellers that you may wish to engage with for resource help with your project.</td>
</tr>

<tr id="emailBody" style="height: 20px;">
<td colspan="2" style="padding-left: 50px;padding-right: 50px; height: 152px;">
<p style="margin-bottom: 0px; margin-top: 0px; font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA';  font-size: 10pt;"></p>
<ul style='padding-left: 17px'>
<li style="font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA';font-size: 10pt;"><i>Intel Solutions Document Library: </i><a href='https://builders.intel.com/solutionslibrary'>https://builders.intel.com/solutionslibrary</a></li>
<li style="font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA'; font-size: 10pt;"><i>For product and pricing related questions, please contact your Motherboard OEM, Intel Authorized Distributors (IAD) or Intel Authorized Supplier (IAS). You can locate a list of IAD or IAS at:</i> <a href='https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/partner/where-to-buy/overview.html'>https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/partner/where-to-buy/overview.html</a></li>
<li style="font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA';  font-size: 10pt;"><i>For product information:</i> <a href='https://ark.intel.com/'>https://ark.intel.com/</a></li>
<li style="font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA';  font-size: 10pt;"><i>Software & Drivers download center: </i><a href='https://downloadcenter.intel.com/'>https://downloadcenter.intel.com/</a></li>
<li style="font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA';  font-size: 10pt;"><i>Intel Community:</i> <a href='https://community.intel.com/'>https://community.intel.com/</a></li>
<li style="font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA';  font-size: 10pt;"><i>Intel Solutions Marketplace catalog:</i><a href=' https://marketplace.intel.com/'> https://marketplace.intel.com/</a></li>
<li style="font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA'; font-size: 10pt;"><i>Intel Customer Support:</i> <a href='https://www.intel.com/support'>https://www.intel.com/support</a> </li>
</ul>
</td>
</tr>


<tr id="salutationDiv" style="padding-bottom: 5px; height: 52px;">
<td colspan="2" style="font-family: 'Intel Clear', TAHOMA; font-size: 10pt; padding-left: 50px; padding-top: 14px; line-height: 18px; height: 52px;">Sincerely, <br> Registration Administrator <br>Developer Zone</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 52.6667px;">
<td colspan="2" style="padding-left: 50px; padding-right: 110px; padding-top: 25px; line-height: 18px; height: 52.6667px; ">
<p style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;"><span style="font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA'; font-size: 10pt;">
*Disclaimer: Additional qualifications may apply. Not all requests are approved. For additional clarifications, please review Intel’s Developer Zone Premier <a href='https://www.intel.com/content/dam/www/public/us/en/documents/license-agreements/developer-zone-premier-terms-of-use.pdf'>Terms & Conditions</a>
 </span><br> <br></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 20px;">
<td colspan="2" style="padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px; padding-top: 15px; height: 17px;" align="center"><hr style="background-color: #e5e5e5; color: #e5e5e5; border: 0 none; height: 1px;"></td>
</tr>
<tr id="emailFooter" style="height: 32px;">
<td style="padding-left: 50px; font-family: 'Intel Clear', TAHOMA; font-size: 9pt; line-height: 16px; color: #666666; padding-top: 13px; height: 32px;width: 60%;height: 32px;">Intel is committed to protecting your privacy. For more Information, <br> please see the <a href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/privacy/intel-privacy-notice.html" style="font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA'; font-size: 9pt; text-decoration: none; color: #086db6 !important; outline: none;">Intel Privacy Notice.</a> <a href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/privacy/intel-cookie-notice.html" style="font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA'; font-size: 9pt; text-decoration: none; color: #086db6 !important; outline: none;">Intel Cookie Notice.</a></td>
<td rowspan="2" style="font-family: 'Intel Clear', TAHOMA; padding-top: 10px; height: 48px;width: 10%;padding-right: 50px;">
<div style="margin-right: -20px;"><img hspace="0px;" src="https://www.intel.com/content/dam/logos/intel-logo.png" height="62px"></div>
</td>
</tr>
<tr id="emailFooter2" style="height: 16px;">
